&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with Cybersecurity on detection and mitigation of threats and vulnerabilities on our network&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interface with application owners and traders to enable business workflows in a secure way&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively enhance support by improving network infrastructure observability, scripting, and communicating requirements to our software engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve our network security processes and documentation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
