&lt;p&gt;You will be the client&#39;s primary point of contact and their voice inside Venn, working closely with our Product, Engineering, Support and Data teams. You work independently, see the big picture, and drive results without waiting for direction.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;After 12 months, success means the rollout phases are live on schedule, adoption targets are met across the client&#39;s teams, and the client sees Venn as a trusted long-term partner. [REVIEW: confirm the 12-month success measures] As Venn grows in Germany, you will have room to help build the customer success function here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
