&lt;li&gt;Build automations, implementation tools and processes that make onboarding faster and repeatable&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design and deliver training programs and materials, building the client&#39;s self-sufficiency on the platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive adoption across a large, distributed portfolio, including property management, customer service and back-office teams&lt;/li&gt;
